msgid "NetTact Agent"
msgstr "NetTact 探针"

msgid ""
"The agent runs network probes on this router and pushes the results to a "
"NetTact server. The binary itself is not part of the package; it is "
"downloaded on first start."
msgstr ""
"探针在本路由器上执行网络探测，并将结果推送到 NetTact 服务器。安装包中不含可执行"
"文件，首次启动时才会下载。"

msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "The agent stays stopped until this is on and a server address is set."
msgstr "只有在启用并填写服务器地址后，探针才会启动。"

msgid "Server URL"
msgstr "服务器地址"

msgid "For example https://nettact.example.com"
msgstr "例如 https://nettact.example.com"

msgid "Must start with http:// or https://"
msgstr "必须以 http:// 或 https:// 开头"

msgid "Enrollment token"
msgstr "注册令牌"

msgid ""
"One-time token from the server. It is only used until this router is "
"enrolled; after that it can be cleared."
msgstr "服务器签发的一次性令牌。注册成功后即不再使用，可以清空。"

msgid "Skip TLS verification"
msgstr "跳过 TLS 验证"

msgid ""
"Accept a server certificate that does not verify. Only for a private CA or an "
"IP-address server you control."
msgstr "接受无法验证的服务器证书。仅适用于自建 CA 或你自己控制的 IP 地址服务器。"

msgid "Upload interval"
msgstr "上报间隔"

msgid "How often buffered telemetry is sent, e.g. 30s or 2m."
msgstr "缓存的遥测数据多久上报一次，例如 30s 或 2m。"

msgid "Binary"
msgstr "程序文件"

msgid "Where to keep the agent"
msgstr "探针存放位置"

msgid ""
"The agent is about 11 MB. In RAM mode it is downloaded to /tmp on every boot "
"and uses no flash at all — the right choice for an 8 or 16 MB router. In "
"flash mode it is downloaded once and survives a reboot offline. Either way "
"the router keeps its identity and never has to enroll twice."
msgstr ""
"探针约 11 MB。内存模式下每次开机都会下载到 /tmp，完全不占用闪存，适合 8MB 或 "
"16MB 的路由器；闪存模式只下载一次，断网重启也能直接运行。两种模式都会保留身份"
"信息，不需要重复注册。"

msgid "RAM — re-download each boot, no flash used"
msgstr "内存 — 每次开机重新下载，不占闪存"

msgid "Flash — download once, needs ~12 MB free"
msgstr "闪存 — 只下载一次，需要约 12 MB 可用空间"

msgid "Download source"
msgstr "下载源"

msgid ""
"Change this to use a local mirror. It must serve versions.json and per-"
"release directories the same way the default does."
msgstr ""
"可改为本地镜像。镜像需要按与默认源相同的方式提供 versions.json 和各版本目录。"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Pin a release, or track the newest one."
msgstr "锁定某个版本，或始终跟随最新版本。"

msgid "Latest (%s)"
msgstr "最新版（%s）"

msgid "%s (pre-release)"
msgstr "%s（预发布）"

msgid ""
"The version list could not be fetched (%s). Enter a release tag such as "
"v1.2.3, or \"latest\"."
msgstr "无法获取版本列表（%s）。请手动填写版本号，例如 v1.2.3，或填 latest。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Start on boot"
msgstr "开机自启"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "Enrolled"
msgstr "已注册"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Not yet"
msgstr "尚未注册"

msgid "Agent binary"
msgstr "探针程序"

msgid "present"
msgstr "已就绪"

msgid "not downloaded yet"
msgstr "尚未下载"

msgid "Storage mode"
msgstr "存放模式"

msgid "Flash"
msgstr "闪存"

msgid "RAM (re-downloaded each boot)"
msgstr "内存（每次开机重新下载）"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

msgid "unrecognised"
msgstr "无法识别"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Enable on boot"
msgstr "开机自启"

msgid "Disable on boot"
msgstr "取消自启"

msgid "Download / update binary"
msgstr "下载 / 更新程序"

msgid "Downloading…"
msgstr "正在下载…"

msgid ""
"Downloading the agent in the background. This can take a few minutes on a "
"slow link."
msgstr "正在后台下载探针。网络较慢时可能需要几分钟。"

msgid "The download failed:"
msgstr "下载失败："

msgid "The agent binary was installed. Restart the service to run it."
msgstr "探针程序已安装。重启服务即可运行。"

msgid "Could not start the download."
msgstr "无法启动下载。"

msgid "Recent log"
msgstr "最近日志"

msgid "No recent log entries."
msgstr "暂无日志。"

msgid ""
"The agent binary is downloaded rather than shipped, so a router with little "
"flash can still run it."
msgstr "探针程序按需下载而非随包安装，因此闪存很小的路由器也能运行。"

msgid "Please wait…"
msgstr "请稍候…"

msgid "Applying…"
msgstr "正在应用…"

msgid "Action failed (exit code %d)."
msgstr "操作失败（退出码 %d）。"
